{"abstract":"We present a tool-based approach for the runtime analysis of communicating processes grounded on probabilistic binary session types. We synthesise a monitor out of a probabilistic session type where each choice point is augmented with a probability distribution. The monitor observes the execution of a process, infers its probabilistic behaviour and issues warnings when the observed behaviour deviates from the one specified by the probabilistic session type.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bartolo Burlò, Christian","Francalanza, Adrian","Scalas, Alceste","Trubiani, Catia","Tuosto, Emilio"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-356138"],"event":{"end":"2021-06-18","place":"Virtual, Online","start":"2021-06-14","title":"23<sup>rd</sup> IFIP WG 6.1 International Conference on Coordination Models and Languagesec 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Bartolo Burlò, Christian"],"country":["Italy","Malta"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Gran Sasso Science Institute","University of Malta"],"keyword":["Monitor Synthesis","Probabilistic session types","Runtime verification"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"towards probabilistic session type monitoring","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/261943073/towards_prob_session_type_monitoring.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The work has been partly supported by: the project MoVeMnt (No: 217987-051) under the Icelandic Research Fund; the BehAPI project funded by the EU H2020 RISE under the Marie Sk?lodowska-Curie action (No: 778233); the MIUR projects PRIN 2017FTXR7S IT MATTERS and 2017TWRCNB SEDUCE; the EU Horizon 2020 project 830929 CyberSec4Europe; the Danish Industriens Fonds Cyberprogram 2020-0489 Security-by-Design in Digital Denmark. The work has been partly supported by: the project MoVeMnt (No: 217987-051) under the Icelandic Research Fund; the BehAPI project funded by the EU H2020 RISE under the Marie Sk lodowska-Curie action (No: 778233); the MIUR projects PRIN 2017FTXR7S IT MATTERS and 2017TWRCNB SEDUCE; the EU Horizon 2020 project 830929 CyberSec4Europe; the Danish Industriens Fonds Cyberprogram 2020-0489 Security-by-Design in Digital Denmark."],"id":"S01-000.00-356138","identifier":[{"id":"85111374325","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-aca39b69-a5d8-4027-96de-3e5a929d6eb4"],"keyword":["Monitor Synthesis","Probabilistic session types","Runtime Verification"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-39167F2669ED7320C39BDEEB4EA04A23"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.08729","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/261943073/towards_prob_session_type_monitoring.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"gran sasso science institute","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Gran Sasso Science Institute","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"mt","key":"university of malta","loc":["Malta","Europe, EU"],"name":"University of Malta","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Formal Methods"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"bartoloburlòpau","last":"Bartolo Burlò","name":"Bartolo Burlò, Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Adrian","key":"francalanzapau","last":"Francalanza","name":"Francalanza, Adrian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alceste","key":"scalaspau","last":"Scalas","locid":"52ce37f8-955f-4a14-b8ed-c59dc660bfc0","name":"Scalas, Alceste","orcid":"0000-0002-1153-6164","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Catia","key":"trubianipau","last":"Trubiani","name":"Trubiani, Catia","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Emilio","key":"tuostopau","last":"Tuosto","name":"Tuosto, Emilio","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ferruccio","key":"damianipedh","last":"Damiani","name":"Damiani, Ferruccio","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ornela","key":"dardhapedh","last":"Dardha","name":"Dardha, Ornela","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-78142-2_7","isbn":["9783030781415"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"106-120","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","title":"Coordination Models and Languages"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85111374325"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-aca39b69-a5d8-4027-96de-3e5a929d6eb4"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Towards Probabilistic Session-Type Monitoring","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-356138","year":"20